{
 "plan": {
  "title": "Scholarship Application Overview",
  "subtitle": "Status distribution, academic performance, and financial eligibility across regions",
  "panels": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Total Applicants",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS n FROM \"scholarship_applicants\"",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Average Marks",
    "sql": "SELECT AVG(\"Marks %\") AS avg_marks FROM \"scholarship_applicants\"",
    "unit": "%"
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Average Family Income",
    "sql": "SELECT AVG(\"Family Income\") AS avg_income FROM \"scholarship_applicants\"",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Pending Applications",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS n FROM \"scholarship_applicants\" WHERE \"Status\" = 'Pending'",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Applications by Status",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Status\", COUNT(*) AS count FROM \"scholarship_applicants\" GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC",
    "x": "Status",
    "y": [
     "count"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Top 10 Talukas by Volume",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Taluka\", COUNT(*) AS count FROM \"scholarship_applicants\" GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10",
    "x": "Taluka",
    "y": [
     "count"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p7",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Average Marks by Category",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Category\", AVG(\"Marks %\") AS avg_marks FROM \"scholarship_applicants\" GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC",
    "x": "Category",
    "y": [
     "avg_marks"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p8",
    "kind": "line",
    "title": "Income vs Marks Distribution",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Family Income\" AS income, AVG(\"Marks %\") AS avg_marks FROM \"scholarship_applicants\" GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
    "x": "income",
    "y": [
     "avg_marks"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p9",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "Top 10 High Performers",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Naam\", \"School\", \"Marks %\" AS marks, \"Family Income\" AS income, \"Status\" FROM \"scholarship_applicants\" WHERE \"Marks %\" IS NOT NULL ORDER BY \"Marks %\" DESC LIMIT 10"
   }
  ],
  "narrative": "This dashboard provides a comprehensive view of the scholarship application pool. There are currently {{p1}} total applicants in the system. The average academic performance across all applicants stands at {{p2}}%, while the average family income reported is {{p3}}. Currently, {{p4}} applications remain in a pending state awaiting review.\n\nThe distribution of application statuses reveals the current workflow bottlenecks, with the bar chart highlighting the volume of approved, rejected, and pending cases. Geographically, the data is concentrated in specific talukas, with the top 10 regions driving the majority of the application volume.\n\nAcademic performance varies significantly by social category, as shown in the category-wise average marks. Additionally, the relationship between family income and academic scores is visualized to identify potential correlations between financial background and educational achievement. Finally, the top 10 high-performing students are listed to highlight exceptional candidates for immediate attention."
 },
